# === Tableau Cloud connection (fill in on your side) ===
#
# How to get a Personal Access Token (PAT):
#   Tableau Cloud にログイン
#   -> 右上のアカウントアイコン -> [マイアカウントの設定]
#   -> [個人用アクセストークン(Personal Access Token)] を新規作成
#   -> トークン名とシークレットを控える (シークレットは一度しか表示されません)
#
# How to use this file:
#   1. rename to  .env.tableau   (remove the .template suffix)
#   2. place it in the kit root (same folder as README.md)
#   3. replace the 4 values below with your own
#
# TABLEAU_SERVER : your Tableau Cloud pod URL, e.g. https://<your-pod>.online.tableau.com
# TABLEAU_SITE_ID: the string after /site/ in your Cloud URL

TABLEAU_PAT_NAME=YOUR_TOKEN_NAME
TABLEAU_PAT_SECRET=YOUR_TOKEN_SECRET
TABLEAU_SERVER=https://<your-pod>.online.tableau.com
TABLEAU_SITE_ID=YOUR_SITE_ID
